---
description: Preserve Austin ISD directory architecture and source/history conventions.
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` before substantial changes.

Preserve normalized IDs and relationships. Use `people.person_id` for stable identity. Keep formal roles in `person_roles`; keep `is_interim` on assignments.

Vertical Team Coordinator is `is_coordinator`, not a role type.
Vertical Team Lead is `is_vertical_team_lead`, separate from coordinator.
Support multiple delegates.
Preserve school-year/history fields and source evidence.

Do not silently replace historical data with current data. Do not present unverified research as authoritative.

When changing the schema, update TypeScript types, JSON seed data, SQLite artifacts, data-access helpers, and UI consumers consistently.

Keep UI independent of storage implementation so JSON can later be replaced by an API/database.

Run the build after significant changes.
